@DigitalTwin_WebAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5297

### Sites
### Get All Sites
GET {{DigitalTwin_WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/sites/GetAllSites
Accept: application/json

### Get Sites By Id
GET {{DigitalTwin_WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/sites/GetSiteById
Accept: application/json

### Get Site By Site Code
GET {{DigitalTwin_WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/sites/GetSiteBySiteCode
Accept: application/json

### Create Site
POST {{DigitalTwin_WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/sites/CreateSite
Accept: application/json

### Update Site
PUT {{DigitalTwin_WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/sites/UpdateSite
Accept: application/json

### Delete Site
DELETE {{DigitalTwin_WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/sites/DeleteSite
Accept: application/json

### External Systems
### Get All External Systems
GET {[DigitalTwin_WebAPI_HostAddress]}/api/externalsystems/GetAllExternalSystems
Accept: application/json

### Get External System by Id
GET {{DigitalTwin_WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/externalsystems/GetExternalSystemById
Accept: application/json

### Get External System By External System Code
GET {{DigitalTwin_WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/externalsystems/GetExternalSystemByCode
Accept: application/json

### Create External System 
POST {{DigitalTwin_WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/externalsystems/CreateExternalSystem
Accept: application/json

### Update External System
PUT {{DigitalTwin_WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/externalsystems/UpdateExternalSystem
Accept: application/json

### Delete External System
DELETE {{DigitalTwin_WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/externalsystems/DeleteExternalSystem
Accept: application/json

### Work Order Status.
### Get All Work Order Statuses
GET {{DigitalTwin_WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/workorderstatuses/GetAllWorkOrderStatuses
Accept: application/json

### Get Work Order Status By Id
GET {{DigitalTwin_WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/workorderstatuses/GetWorkOrderStatusById
Accept: application/json

### Create Work Order Status
POST {{DigitalTwin_WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/workorderstatuses/CreateWorkOrderStatus
Accept: application/json

### Update Work Order Status
